      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHERE'S PABLO (2) caught the eye on debut when big odds but flew the boxes with a fast early split and ran away with a 2 length win at Healesville over 350m in 19.50. Promising type who will be in this for a long way. EIGHT MATES (1) had a low draw latest where he found trouble and fell over 390m at Warrnambool. Has the ability and can atone with the right run. DR. STEFAN (6) took the sit on the lead from an outside box but levelled up and drew clear to score (19.97) at this track in a Maiden over 350m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Expected to feature again. RUNWAY JADE (7) has won at this course and distance, should be thereabouts.",
